# Helper agents

The user explicitly requested on 2026-10-31 that helper agents always use
`gpt-6.1-sol` with `medium` reasoning.

- Use this model and reasoning level when delegating suitable work.
- Where the tool requires it, use a fresh context and provide the necessary task context explicitly.
- Do not silently substitute another model or reasoning level; disclose unavailability.
- Keep agent scopes separate, coordinate shared files, and verify their delivered changes.
